  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preventing and responding to the cholera outbreak in the South West and Littoral Regions of Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Responding to cholera outbreaks in Littoral and SW Regions of Cameroon. Providing PPE, supplies and training Community Health Workers, and PPE and WASH kit distributions to households. The project directly targets 2,034 people affected by cholera; 1587 in SW region and 447 Littoral.</narrative>
